Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-contextREGEX(.*)

{
    "type": "Property",
    "value": {
        "f": 3.14,
        "i": 1
    },
    "xtra": {
        "type": "Property",
        "value": 1
    }
}


12. GET the attribute p_o with sysAttrs
=======================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Length: 239
Content-Type: application/json
Date: REGEX(.*)
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-contextREGEX(.*)

{
    "createdAt": "REGEX(.*)",
    "modifiedAt": "REGEX(.*)",
    "type": "Property",
    "value": {
        "f": 3.14,
        "i": 1
    },
    "xtra": {
        "createdAt": "REGEX(.*)",
        "modifiedAt": "REGEX(.*)",
        "type": "Property",
        "value": 1
    }
}


13. GET the attribute p_o in Concise format
===========================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Length: 35
Content-Type: application/json
Date: REGEX(.*)
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-contextREGEX(.*)

{
    "value": {
        "f": 3.14,
        "i": 1
    },
    "xtra": 1
}


14. GET the attribute p_o in Simplified format
==============================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Length: 26
Content-Type: application/json
Date: REGEX(.*)
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-contextREGEX(.*)

{
    "value": {
        "f": 3.14,
        "i": 1
    }
}


21. GET the attribute r_s (it's a relationship with a JSON String value)
========================================================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Length: 78
Content-Type: application/json
Date: REGEX(.*)
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-contextREGEX(.*)

{
    "object": "urn:E2",
    "type": "Relationship",
    "xtra": {
        "type": "Property",
        "value": 1
    }
}


22. GET the attribute r_s with sysAttrs
=======================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Length: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Date: REGEX(.*)
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-contextREGEX(.*)

{
    "createdAt": "REGEX(.*)",
    "modifiedAt": "REGEX(.*)",
    "object": "urn:E2",
    "type": "Relationship",
    "xtra": {
        "createdAt": "REGEX(.*)",
        "modifiedAt": "REGEX(.*)",
